236	        ? `That's measured from your own builds — yours have cost about ` +
237	          `${state.avgBuildCredits} credits each — and it's the same number the credit ` +
238	          `meter in the app uses. Bigger changes cost more, small edits cost less.`
239	        : `That's based on a typical Kodely build (about ${state.avgBuildCredits} ` +
240	          `credits). Once you've run a few, it uses your own measured average instead ` +
241	          `— the same number the credit meter in the app shows.`,
242	    ),
243	  ];
244	
245	  if (input.canTopUp) {
